    <h2> About </h2>
    <p>
        Maison Aurelle is a modern fashion house built on the belief<br> 
        that style is more than clothing — it is identity, confidence,<br>
        and self-expression. Founded with a passion for timeless elegance<br>
        and contemporary design, Maison Aurelle creates pieces that embody<br>
        sophistication, strength, and individuality.<br>
    </p>
    <p>
        At Maison Aurelle, we blend classic craftsmanship with modern aesthetics to produce<br>
        collections that are refined yet bold. Every fabric is carefully selected,<br> 
        every stitch thoughtfully placed, and every silhouette designed to empower <br>
        the wearer. Our goal is simple: to create fashion that feels luxurious, effortless, <br>
        and unforgettable.
